# Who reviews changes to this repo. GitHub requests a review from the matching owners on every pull request, and,
# with branch protection's "Require review from Code Owners" on, an owner must approve before merging.
# The last matching line wins. Every file here applies to every repo in the organization, so changes are reviewed
# by the people who run how we work.
#
# Teams are managed in the organization's settings, under Teams. A team listed here must have write access to
# this repo, or GitHub ignores the line.

# Everything
*                                   @sensenetInc/platform

